# The sabotage plan of vos-sched-rr (VOS04 5.6): `vos-link gen-build` turns each entry into one line 9 of BUILD and BUILD_windows.
# `<tier>/<name> <fault> [attack=<op>]`: <name> is a claim (exhaustive) or an example of code/specs/vos-sched-rr.warrant, <fault> a fault
# bound in evidence.bindings; `field-flip` needs attack=<op> (VER04j 4.8).  `vos-link check-component` requires that every bound
# fault and every field-flip operation is attacked; whether the claim CATCHES it is the shared checker's, at build time.
